  "body": "Control an already running Shows desktop from another PC with the new shows-remote executable, using either its interactive terminal UI or one-shot commands over existing SSH. The target retains its player and authoritative NAS database; live status, explicit play/pause acknowledgements, bounded waits and disconnect handling keep the controller honest.\n\nExtends remote-control.md, desktop-status.md and desktop-distribution.md; runner controls preserve round-and-advance.md invariants, and both executables ship in the same verified channel bundle. Validated with 112 workspace tests, including native Windows agent pipe inheritance, Clippy for the new crates, the frontend build and terminal distribution smoke test.\n\n[SHOWS-1](https://openproject.romaine.life/wp/SHOWS-1)",
  "changed_files": 28,
